            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Nebius Q3 sales soar by 355%, Sea Limited misses profit estimates",
            "description": "<p>Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Nebius (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NBIS\">NBIS</a>) reporting its third quarter sales skyrocket by over 350% while inking a new AI deal with Meta Platforms (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>),  Singapore-based Sea Limited (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SE\">SE</a>) missed profit estimates in its latest quarter, and BigBear.AI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BBAI\">BBAI</a>) soaring by nearly 20% in Tuesday's pre-market trading after beating Wall Street estimates.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Morning Brief host Julie Hyman tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Nebius (NBIS) reporting its third quarter sales skyrocket by over 350% while inking a new AI deal with Meta Platforms (META), Singapore-based Sea Limited (SE) missed profit estimates in its latest quarter, and BigBear.AI (BBAI) soaring by nearly 20% in Tuesday's pre-market trading after beating Wall Street estimates. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Morning Brief.",
            "pubDate": "2025-11-11T14:28:36Z",
